* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB4 VB1 VB3 VB2 VB5 IB VIN VOUT VREF
CL VOUT net1 1p
M10 EAO VB3 VZ VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
